@title PLC overview and a bad card layout: triangles, not coloured sentences
@area Schematic
# T8: Draw > PLC > PLC overview. A card or I/O problem is a triangle row with its sentence in the popup; a layout that does not parse is a chip with the reason. This checks both draw and fit.
key ctrl+n
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text add card DI99999999999
wait 6
key Enter
wait 10
shot bad-layout-chip
key Escape
wait 5
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text plc overview
wait 6
key Enter
wait 20
expect "The project has no PLC cards yet"
shot plc-overview
check_layout
